      "body": "## Motivation\n\n`create_kt_config_from_server_args` reads `num_hidden_layers` from the top-level `hf_config` only. Multimodal `*ForConditionalGeneration` checkpoints keep the language model's layer count under `text_config`:\n\n| checkpoint | top-level `num_hidden_layers` | `text_config.num_hidden_layers` |\n|---|---|---|\n| Qwen/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B (`Qwen3_5MoeForConditionalGeneration`) | missing | 40 |\n| a Qwen3.8-Flash-Next checkpoint (`Qwen4ExpForConditionalGeneration`) | missing | 48 |\n\nSo `KTConfig.num_layers` is `None` for these models, and the guard in `KTEPWrapperMethod.create_weights` that sets `max_deferred_experts_per_token` to 0 on the last MoE layer never fires when `--kt-max-deferred-experts-per-token` is set. We noticed it because a hook of ours keyed on the last layer never ran on a Qwen3.8-Flash-Next checkpoint.\n\n## Modifications\n\nFall back to `text_config.num_hidden_layers` when the top-level value is missing. Configs that have a top-level value are unchanged.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNo change for configs with a top-level `num_hidden_layers`. For the multimodal checkpoints above, the only effect is that the existing last-layer guard now applies.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nN/A.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the Format code with pre-commit.\n- [ ] Add unit tests (small config-lookup change; happy to add one if wanted).\n- [ ] Update documentation (not needed).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results (N/A).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #36243646791](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36243646791)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #36243646490](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36243646490)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #36243646741](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36243646741)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
